# Constraints inferred while drawing (an extension): a line, then one
# from its end nearly square to it, which is made perpendicular; a line
# elsewhere nearly parallel to the first, made parallel; and one at
# another angle nearly as long as the first, made equal to it. The
# mouse moves twice to each point, as a drag does: what is suggested is
# worked out before the point follows the mouse.
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 300 209
move 300 210
down L 300 210
up L 300 210
move 290 309
move 290 310
down L 290 310
up L 290 310
key esc
key s
move 200 330
down L 200 330
up L 200 330
move 300 340
move 300 341
down L 300 341
up L 300 341
key esc
key s
move 400 100
down L 400 100
up L 400 100
